  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webstorage.html#the-storage-interface\r\n\r\n> value = storage.[getItem](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webstorage.html#dom-storage-getitem) (key)\r\n> value = storage[key]\r\n> \r\n> Returns the current value associated with the given key, or null if the given key does not exist\\.\r\n\r\nActually `localStorage['foo']` returns `undefined` rather than `null` in most browsers though `localStorage.getItem('foo')` returns null.",
